Full-Stack Developer

About Me

I am a Full-Stack Developer focused on building real-time, production-ready applications with clean architecture and reliable performance. I enjoy working on systems where correctness, scalability, and user experience truly matter, especially in chat applications, notification systems, and API-driven platforms.

I work across both backend and frontend, designing secure APIs, handling real-time communication, and deploying applications to production environments. I approach development as a problem solver, paying close attention to edge cases, system behavior in real-world scenarios, and long-term maintainability.

