Projects
Real-Time Chat Application

Built a full-stack real-time chat application with Socket.IO

Implemented one-to-one messaging, message persistence, and presence tracking

Designed backend APIs using Node.js and Express

Stored messages and user data in PostgreSQL

Managed online/offline state using Redis

Implemented JWT-based authentication

Deployed frontend using Vercel

Notification System (Chat-Based)

Designed a production-style notification architecture

Implemented notification rules based on:

User online/offline state

Active chat presence

Background vs foreground app state

Integrated push notification logic and in-app notifications

Ensured correct delivery without duplicates

Focused on reliability and real-world behavior

API-Driven Backend Services

Designed and implemented RESTful APIs

Handled authentication, authorization, and secure data access

Focused on clean structure, scalability, and maintainability

Debugged production-level issues such as token expiration and data consistency

Development Approach

Write clean, maintainable code

Focus on real-world behavior, not demo logic

Think about scalability and correctness

Debug systematically and carefully

Build software that works reliably in production

Goals

Grow as a backend-strong full-stack developer

Build scalable real-time systems

Work on products where engineering quality matters

Continuously improve system design and architecture skills

